    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4006ecdb2ea060696897ddfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的温柔体贴远比我想像中还要深厚。\n在感恩那份心意的同时，\n我也深深体会到自己有多么不成熟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "293ec5f7edb4237e46c6c97a789ab0f0c5d72ff879cfb2aff8e4fe7cfdce1cb6",
