      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，既然她打算继续前进，\n我能做的就是陪她一起勇往直前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86fb20e59d1fce49e526419b833d5a306b17d9aabd4ba87ffdd3cfd9632bd5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
